{"id":"643184","name":"紫薯糯米饼","author":"沐祠姐姐","authorId":"12934813","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/643184/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫薯","amount":"2只"},{"name":"糯米","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"炼乳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"紫薯去皮。","img":"images/643184/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切薄片，上锅蒸五到十分钟。","img":"images/643184/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒸熟的紫薯加入炼乳和白砂糖压成泥。","img":"images/643184/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"活成泥。","img":"images/643184/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搓成丸子。","img":"images/643184/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"糯米粉。","img":"images/643184/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量热水。","img":"images/643184/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"活成团。","img":"images/643184/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下面糯米上面紫薯丸子包起来。","img":"images/643184/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包成这样。","img":"images/643184/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"平底锅刷油把包好的糯米饼放进去煎。","img":"images/643184/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"撒上黑芝麻，翻面再煎。","img":"images/643184/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/643184/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}